        <p source="#source-22107-22172"><seg source="#source-22107-22172">新聞記者・編輯者、雑誌記者・編輯者、校正掛</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-22210-22281" style="padding-inline-start: 1em">
        <p source="#source-22231-22279"><hi rend="bold" source="#source-22231-22279" corresp="#source-22231-22246 #source-22255-22279"><seg source="#source-22246-22255">出版者</seg></hi></p>
