        <p source="#source-22316-22345"><seg source="#source-22316-22345">図書出版、雑誌出版</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-22383-22457" style="padding-inline-start: 1em">
        <p source="#source-22404-22455"><hi rend="bold" source="#source-22404-22455" corresp="#source-22404-22419 #source-22431-22455"><seg source="#source-22419-22431">放送局員</seg></hi></p>
