      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-25750-25831"><hi rend="bold" source="#source-25750-25829" corresp="#source-25750-25765 #source-25805-25829"><hi rend="text-combine-upright" snh:layout-kind="tcy" source="#source-25765-25796" corresp="#source-25767-25796"><seg source="#source-25765-25767">10</seg></hi><seg source="#source-25796-25805">、娯楽</seg></hi></p>
